Stick (@kamalie-stick: 0, #part-of @kamalie-fracture) {
A thin brown strip of connected parts. Its continuous expression follows pointer angle and distance while activated. Repeated use and impact wear the local parts. Fracture preserves the component containing the grip when that part survives.

The custom extension below is authored definition data. The first implementation consumes its matching materials.json snapshot; live Record loading is future work.
}

Extension @kamalie-stick "kamalie.material" {
    revision 1
    id "stick"
    responsive true
    integrity 7.0
    impact_transfer 0.028
    wear 0.08
    part_size 2.5
    color [0.46 0.28 0.12]
    spawn_weight 2
}
